":{"year":207,"label":"建安十二年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"dongyuan-y207","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"dongyuan-q-o067","basis":"建安十二年"},"evidence":["dongyuan-e-o067a-q","dongyuan-q-o067","xiahoucao-q-o006","wuzhu-q-o011","zhuge-q-o005","zhuge-q-b-40accddaa1b32119c6cb"]},"ordering_evidence":"dongyuan-e-o067a-q","source_order":[6,375,"O067a"],"related_events":[{"event":"wudi-e-o117b","type":"related","evidence":["dongyuan-e-o067a-q","wudi-e-o117b-q"]}],"order":1710}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0198","name":"袁尚","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0221","name":"袁熙","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0243","name":"田畴","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0246","name":"速仆丸","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0247","name":"公孙康","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"dongyuan-e-o067a-q","section":"chapter-006","block":"b-893eb6895390377ea179","layer":"original","quote":"十二年，太祖至辽西，击乌丸。尚、熙与乌丸，逆军战，败走奔辽东。公孙康诱斩之，送其首。﹝二﹞","section_title":"董二袁刘传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0017.xhtml","index":374,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-cfa6d629b8b47b2f49ed","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-32cde7e21d373e6d01d7","layer":"original","quote":"十二年〖1〗，太祖征三郡乌丸，屠柳城。袁尚等奔辽东，康斩送尚首。语在《武纪》。封康襄平侯，拜左将军","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":191,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":26,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o117b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-3982d5aa554a26f2c3db","layer":"original","quote":"康即斩尚、熙及速仆丸等，传其首。诸将或问：“公还而康斩送尚、熙，何也？”公曰：“彼素畏尚等，吾急之则并力，缓之则自相图；其势然也。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":636,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十二年：建安十二年（公元 207）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":623,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-20efb4f3aff50357a189","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o111","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-01eaf58b917a530c61d5","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春二月〖1〗，公自淳于还邺。丁酉〖2〗，令曰：“吾起义兵诛暴乱，于今十九年；所征必克，岂吾功哉？乃贤士大夫之力也！天下虽未悉定，吾当要与贤士大夫共定之；而专享其劳〖3〗，吾何以安焉？其促定功行封〖4〗。”于是大封功臣二十余人，皆为列侯；其余各以次受封；及复死事之孤〖5〗：轻重各有差〖6〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":621,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-34572da0cb0069de028c","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-980722d8367b4a4376f3","layer":"original","quote":"辽东斩送袁尚首，令三军：“敢有哭之者，斩！”畴以尝为尚所辟，乃往吊祭。太祖亦不问","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":230,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":81,"end":121,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
